id: cpc_secondary_driver_spi_hw_crc
package: cpc
description: >
  SPI driver Hardware CRC acceleration with the GPCRC in reception.
  By using this component, CPU usage is reduced when receiving CPC
  frames. The cost is the monopoly of the GPCRC engine, the use of  a third DMA channel and another DMA SYNC bit.

label: CPC Secondary - SPI Hardware CRC Acceleration
category: Services|Co-Processor Communication|Secondary Device|Driver
quality: experimental
ui_hints:
  visibility: never
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib

config_file:
- path: config/sl_cpc_drv_secondary_spi_hw_crc_config.h
provides:
- name: cpc_secondary_driver_spi_hw_crc
requires:
- name: emlib_gpcrc
- name: cpc_secondary_driver_spi
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: cpc_driver_hw_crc
root_path: cpc
